re_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.webp?t=1787144680 width=1560 height=130 /></span><strong>Explore Charming Worlds ⭐</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through peaceful forests, snowy paths, forgotten ruins, and cozy hidden areas filled with small stories and secrets. Every region holds lost items, friendly creatures, tiny critters, and small moments waiting to be discovered.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✏️ Fill your journal map as you journey through the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Solve cozy puzzles using levers, lights, weights, portals, rotating paths and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Discover and catch adorable critters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 Enjoy fishing, wandering, and relaxed exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.poster.avif?t=1787144680\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.webm?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.mp4?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.avif?t=1787144680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.webp?t=1787144680 width=1560 height=130 /></span><strong>Restore &amp; Customize Your Village 🏘️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring life back